WEBVTT

00:08.965 --> 00:10.310
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.413 --> 00:12.103
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.206 --> 00:13.551
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.655 --> 00:15.344
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.448 --> 00:18.413
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.517 --> 00:20.620
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.724 --> 00:22.655
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.758 --> 00:24.689
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.793 --> 00:26.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.482 --> 00:28.689
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.793 --> 00:30.206
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.310 --> 00:32.689
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.793 --> 00:34.620
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.724 --> 00:36.620
all:
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
全部：
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.724 --> 00:38.586
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.689 --> 00:40.517
♪ SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.620 --> 00:41.758
- ♪ SPONGEBOB
- ♪ 海绵宝宝

00:41.862 --> 00:44.068
♪ SQUAREPANTS!
♪ 方裤！

00:44.172 --> 00:46.517
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.620 --> 00:48.827
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.931 --> 00:50.344
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:04.000 --> 01:05.206
- AFTER YOU.
- 您先请。

01:05.310 --> 01:07.137
- OH, THANK YOU, PATRICK.
- 哦，谢谢你，帕特里克。

01:12.655 --> 01:14.620
- MY TURN.
- 轮到我了。

01:18.862 --> 01:21.103
- NEATO.
- 尼托。

01:21.206 --> 01:25.655
WATCH THIS.
注意这个。

01:25.758 --> 01:28.482
- WOW.
- 哇。

01:28.586 --> 01:30.344
- [yawning]
- [打哈欠]

01:30.448 --> 01:32.896
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

01:33.000 --> 01:34.034
[bubble pops]
OH! OH!
[泡泡爆破]
哦！哦！

01:34.137 --> 01:37.068
MONOSODIUM GLUTAMATE!
谷氨酸钠！

01:42.413 --> 01:44.275
- YOU KNOW, PATRICK,
[sniffs]
- 你知道，帕特里克，
[嗅嗅]

01:44.379 --> 01:46.413
WE SHOULD SPICE UP OUR
BUBBLE BLOWING.
我们应该为我们的
吹泡泡。

01:46.517 --> 01:48.206
- YEAH, YEAH.
- 是啊是啊。

01:48.310 --> 01:51.241
SPICE.
香料。

01:51.344 --> 01:52.896
NO SPICE.
没有香料。

01:53.000 --> 01:55.137
HMM.
唔。

01:55.241 --> 01:57.034
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:57.137 --> 02:00.482
HOT SAUCE!
辣酱！

02:00.586 --> 02:02.310
[spits]
[吐口水]

02:02.413 --> 02:04.689
SPICY BUBBLES.
辛辣的泡泡。

02:04.793 --> 02:07.206
- [squeals]
- [尖叫声]

02:16.827 --> 02:18.172
HMM.
唔。

02:18.275 --> 02:21.862
[screams]
[尖叫声]

02:21.965 --> 02:24.689
[laughs]
[笑]

02:32.896 --> 02:35.551
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:39.241 --> 02:44.310
I WONDER IF HOT SAUCE
IS BAD FOR OUR EYES.
我想知道是否有辣酱
对我们的眼睛有害。

02:44.413 --> 02:45.793
both: NAH.
两人：不。

02:45.896 --> 02:48.310
[laughter]
[笑声]

02:57.034 --> 03:00.655
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

03:02.551 --> 03:05.724
[laughter]
[笑声]

03:05.827 --> 03:08.482
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:08.586 --> 03:09.620
[sighs]
[叹气]

03:09.724 --> 03:12.068
20 YEARS OF PAINSTAKING CARE
20年精心呵护

03:12.172 --> 03:15.068
AND MY BONSAI PORTRAIT
IS ALMOST COMPLETE.
和我的盆景肖像
即将完成。

03:15.172 --> 03:16.896
OH! OH, MY.
WHAT'S THIS?
哦！哦，我的。
这是什么？

03:17.000 --> 03:18.689
I MISSED A SPOT.
我错过了一个地方。

03:18.793 --> 03:20.137
NOT TO WORRY.
不用担心。

03:20.241 --> 03:21.827
YOU'LL BE PERFECT SOON.
您很快就会变得完美。

03:21.931 --> 03:24.103
AS PERFECT AS ME.
和我一样完美。

03:24.206 --> 03:25.620
HMM.
唔。

03:25.724 --> 03:28.310
[SpongeBob and Patrick yell]
[海绵宝宝和帕特里克大喊]

03:28.413 --> 03:30.137
OH, LOOK WHAT I'VE DONE!
哦，看看我做了什么！

03:30.241 --> 03:32.448
[crying]
OH, NO!
[哭泣]
哦，不！

03:32.551 --> 03:34.793
- SQUIDWARD.
- 章鱼哥。

03:34.896 --> 03:36.379
- WHAT? WHAT?
WHO SAID THAT?
- 什么？什么？
谁说的？

03:36.482 --> 03:39.586
- IT'S ME, YOUR BONSAI,
SQUIDWARD.
- 这是我，你的盆景，
章鱼哥。

03:39.689 --> 03:43.206
WILL YOU GRANT ME
MY FINAL REQUEST?
你愿意给我吗
我的最终要求？

03:43.310 --> 03:45.379
- UM, OF COURSE.
WHAT--WHAT--WHAT IS IT?
- 嗯，当然。
什么——什么——这是什么？

03:45.482 --> 03:47.344
- AVENGE ME.
- 为我报仇。

03:47.448 --> 03:50.275
- "AVENGE ME"?
- “为我报仇”？

03:50.379 --> 03:55.931
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:56.034 --> 03:59.448
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

03:59.551 --> 04:03.137
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

04:05.689 --> 04:08.482
[laughter]
[笑声]

04:08.586 --> 04:09.862
- I MUST HAVE MORE.
- 我必须有更多。

04:09.965 --> 04:13.793
- YOU WANT MORE?
- 你想要更多吗？

04:16.206 --> 04:17.896
- SPONGEBOB, YOU MORON!
- 海绵宝宝，你这个白痴！

04:18.000 --> 04:20.724
YOU'VE RUINED MY BON...
你毁了我的美好...

04:20.827 --> 04:21.758
SAI.
赛伊。

04:21.862 --> 04:23.793
[explosion]
[爆炸]

04:30.241 --> 04:32.689
- LET'S GO TO SANDY'S.
- 我们去桑迪家吧

04:32.793 --> 04:33.862
SANDY! SANDY!
沙！沙！

04:33.965 --> 04:35.344
CHECK OUT THESE NEW
SPICY BUBBLES
看看这些新的
辣味泡泡

04:35.448 --> 04:37.344
THAT PATRICK INVENTED.
帕特里克发明的。

04:37.448 --> 04:40.172
- YEAH, I THINKED IT UP
WITH MY OWN HEAD.
- 是的，我想到了
用我自己的头脑。

04:40.275 --> 04:42.137
NOW I'M AS SMART AS SANDY.
现在我和桑迪一样聪明了。

04:42.241 --> 04:43.827
- MAYBE EVEN SMARTER.
- 也许更聪明。

04:43.931 --> 04:45.344
- SMARTER, HUH?
- 更聪明，嗯？

04:45.448 --> 04:48.206
WELL, I'D LOVE TO TRY OUT YOUR
NEW FANCY BUBBLES, PATRICK,
嗯，我很想尝试一下你的
新奇特的泡泡，帕特里克，

04:48.310 --> 04:51.344
BUT I'VE GOT TO FIX THESE
AIR LINES TO MY TREE DOME.
但我必须解决这些问题
通往我的树穹的航线。

04:51.448 --> 04:53.137
THEY'RE ALL CLOGGED UP
AND THE LACK OF FRESH AIR
他们都堵塞了
以及缺乏新鲜空气

04:53.241 --> 04:54.931
IS MAKING ME WOOZY.
让我头晕目眩。

04:55.034 --> 04:59.206
- WHY DON'T YOU JUST BREATHE
WATER LIKE A SMART PERSON?
- 为什么你不呼吸
像聪明人一样喝水？

04:59.310 --> 05:03.758
[breathing heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

05:03.862 --> 05:05.206
GUESS YOU'RE JUST TOO DUMB.
我猜你太笨了。

05:05.310 --> 05:06.344
- I KNOW, SANDY.
- 我知道，桑迪。

05:06.448 --> 05:07.931
I'LL USE THESE SPICY BUBBLES.
我会用这些辣味泡泡。

05:08.034 --> 05:11.241
THEY'LL CLEAN OUT YOUR PIPES
FOR YOU.
他们会清理你的管道
为了您。

05:11.344 --> 05:12.689
- THAT'S SWEET OF YOU,
SPONGEBOB,
- 你真可爱，
海绵宝宝，

05:12.793 --> 05:14.034
BUT A BUNCH OF
LITTLE OLD BUBBLES
但是一堆
老小泡泡

05:14.137 --> 05:16.896
AIN'T GONNA CLEAR
THESE AIR LINES.
不会清楚
这些航空公司。

05:23.965 --> 05:25.896
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:29.586 --> 05:30.827
- OOPS.
- 哎呀。

05:30.931 --> 05:32.344
- I'LL TAR AND FEATHER YOU
NINCOMPOOPS LATER.
- 我会给你焦油和羽毛
后来的 NINCOMPOOPS。

05:32.448 --> 05:34.620
MY SUIT'S AIR SUPPLY
IS NEARING EMPTY.
我的套装的供气
快空了。

05:34.724 --> 05:37.310
LUCKILY, I HAVE JUST ENOUGH AIR
IN MY SUBMARINE
幸运的是，我有足够的空气
在我的潜艇里

05:37.413 --> 05:39.586
TO GET TO THE SURFACE
AND REFILL MY AIR TANKS.
到达地面
并重新填充我的气罐。

05:39.689 --> 05:41.344
- WHEW!
THANK GOODNESS.
- 哇！
谢天谢地。

05:41.448 --> 05:44.758
ALLOW ME TO GET THE DOOR.
请允许我开门。

05:44.862 --> 05:46.793
- EVEN I KNEW THAT WAS DUMB.
- 即使我知道那很愚蠢。

05:46.896 --> 05:49.482
- OH, NO! I ONLY HAVE
A FEW MINUTES OF AIR LEFT.
- 哦，不！我只有
还剩几分钟的空气。

05:49.586 --> 05:52.172
I'M FAR TOO DIZZY ALREADY.
我已经头晕了。

05:52.275 --> 05:53.517
YOU HAVE TO DRIVE, SPONGEBOB.
你必须开车，海绵宝宝。

05:53.620 --> 05:57.793
- [cheers]
- [干杯]

05:57.896 --> 05:59.103
HOW'S SANDY DOING
BACK THERE?
桑迪怎么样
回到那里？

05:59.206 --> 06:02.275
- NOT SURE.
LET ME CHECK.
- 没有把握。
让我检查一下。

06:02.379 --> 06:04.068
[alarm beeping]
- [gasps]
[警报声]
- [喘气]

06:04.172 --> 06:07.689
- HI THERE,
PATTY-PAT-PAT-PAT-PATRICK.
- 你好，
帕蒂-帕特-帕特-帕特-帕特里克。

06:07.793 --> 06:09.310
CAREFUL WHERE YOU'RE BREATHING!
小心你呼吸的地方！

06:09.413 --> 06:12.827
YOU DON'T WANT TO DISTURB
THE SUB-ATOMIC PARTICLE RODEO.
你不想打扰
亚原子粒子竞技表演。

06:12.931 --> 06:15.310
YEEHAW, MICRO-DOGGIES!
呀呀，微型小狗！

06:15.413 --> 06:16.965
ROPE THEM MOLECULES.
束缚它们的分子。

06:17.068 --> 06:18.310
- SHE'S TOTALLY LOSING IT!
- 她完全失去了它！

06:18.413 --> 06:22.620
- [grunts]
ARE THERE COBWEBS ON MY FACE?
- [咕哝]
我脸上有蜘蛛网吗？

06:22.724 --> 06:25.137
'CAUSE IT FEELS LIKE
THERE'S COBWEBS ON MY FACE.
因为感觉就像
我脸上有蜘蛛网。

06:25.241 --> 06:26.379
- NEVER MIND.
- 没关系。

06:26.482 --> 06:28.034
SHE SEEMS FINE.
她看起来很好。

06:28.137 --> 06:30.241
- HOLD ON JUST A LITTLE LONGER,
SANDY.
- 再坚持一会儿，
桑迪。

06:30.344 --> 06:31.241
WE'RE ALMOST THERE.
我们快到了。

06:31.344 --> 06:32.827
I CAN SEE SUNLIGHT.
我能看到阳光。

06:32.931 --> 06:35.586
HORRIBLE, DEHYDRATING SUNLIGHT.
[groans]
可怕的、令人脱水的阳光。
[呻吟]

06:35.689 --> 06:37.206
- GIVE ME THAT WHEEL,
SQUAREBUTT!
- 把那个轮子给我，
方屁股！

06:37.310 --> 06:38.931
I KNOW A SHORTCUT.
我知道一条捷径。

06:39.034 --> 06:43.379
[all exclaiming]
[所有人惊呼]

06:43.482 --> 06:44.793
- MAKE SURE AND HOLD HER TIGHT,
PATRICK.
- 确保并抱紧她，
帕特里克。

06:44.896 --> 06:46.965
- WELL, DON'T WORRY,
SHE'S NOT GOING ANYWHERE.
- 好吧，别担心，
她哪儿也不去。

06:51.862 --> 06:57.551
- YOU TASTE LIKE GLASS.
- 你尝起来像玻璃。

06:57.655 --> 06:59.758
- BLAH, FRESH AIR.
- 废话，新鲜空气。

06:59.862 --> 07:01.517
LET'S HURRY UP
AND GET THIS OVER WITH.
让我们快点
结束这一切吧。

07:01.620 --> 07:02.793
- GET WHAT OVER WITH?
- 结束什么？

07:02.896 --> 07:04.827
- WHERE'S SANDY?
- I THOUGHT SHE WAS WITH YOU.
- 桑迪在哪里？
- 我以为她和你在一起。

07:04.931 --> 07:06.310
- UH-OH.
[rumbling]
- 呃-哦。
[隆隆声]

07:06.413 --> 07:08.655
- HANG ON, FELLAS!
- 坚持住，伙计们！

07:08.758 --> 07:13.448
I GOT A HANKERING
FOR A KRABBY PATTY.
我有一个渴望
蟹肉饼。

07:13.551 --> 07:15.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:15.275 --> 07:17.517
- SANDY, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 桑迪，你在做什么？

07:17.620 --> 07:20.241
THE AIR IS UP THERE.
空气就在那里。

07:20.344 --> 07:24.586
- YEAH, YEAH, RIGHT AFTER I GRAB
A QUICK BITE AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
- 是啊，是啊，就在我抓住之后
快速咬一口甲壳蟹。

07:24.689 --> 07:28.000
YEEHAW!
[both yelling]
耶哈！
[两人大喊]

07:36.482 --> 07:40.620
OH, WELL, I GUESS I WON'T
BE NEEDING THIS ANYMORE.
哦，好吧，我想我不会
不再需要这个了。

07:45.206 --> 07:49.206
- NO, SANDY, YOU NEED AIR,
NOT FOOD.
- 不，桑迪，你需要空气，
不是食物。

07:49.310 --> 07:51.758
- HEY! WHAT'S GOING ON
OUT HERE?
- 嘿！发生了什么事
在这里？

07:51.862 --> 07:54.413
- MR. KRABS, SANDY'S RUN OUT
OF THAT CRAZY AIR STUFF
- 先生。蟹蟹，桑迪用完了
那些疯狂的空气物质

07:54.517 --> 07:55.413
THAT SHE NEEDS TO BREATHE!
她需要呼吸！

07:55.517 --> 07:57.000
WE HAVE TO FIND SOME
RIGHT NOW,
我们必须找到一些
现在，

07:57.103 --> 07:59.379
OR SHE'LL BE HEADED FOR
THE LAST ROUNDUP.
否则她将前往
最后的综述。

07:59.482 --> 08:02.137
- WELL, OKAY, I SUPPOSE I CAN'T
HAVE HER CROAKING
- 好吧，我想我不能
让她嘎嘎叫

08:02.241 --> 08:03.137
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅。

08:03.241 --> 08:04.827
HEH, BE BAD FOR BUSINESS.
呵呵，对生意不利。

08:04.931 --> 08:08.586
ALL RIGHT, LET'S SEE HERE.
HMM, OXYGEN.
好吧，让我们看看这里。
嗯，氧气。

08:08.689 --> 08:10.724
O2, I BELIEVE.
O2，我相信。

08:10.827 --> 08:13.689
GOOD OLD ATOMIC NUMBER EIGHT.
很好的老原子八号。

08:13.793 --> 08:14.793
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

08:14.896 --> 08:18.896
- UH, UH, HEY!
EVERYONE LOOK.
- 呃，呃，嘿！
大家看。

08:19.000 --> 08:22.172
THERE'S SOME AIR BUBBLES
TRAPPED ON THE CEILING.
有一些气泡
被困在天花板上。

08:22.275 --> 08:23.724
- BUT HOW ARE YOU GONNA
GET THEM DOWN?
- 但你要怎样
把他们打倒？

08:23.827 --> 08:26.344
- NEVER FEAR,
I KNOW WHAT TO DO.
- 永远不要害怕，
我知道该怎么做。

08:26.448 --> 08:28.931
WE CAN USE THESE STRAWS
TO SUCK THE BUBBLES DOWN.
我们可以使用这些吸管
将气泡吸下去。

08:29.034 --> 08:31.620
- WAIT A MINUTE, THOSE STRAWS
COST ME MONEY.
- 等一下，那些吸管
花了我钱。

08:31.724 --> 08:33.448
- OH, DON'T WORRY, MR. KRABS,
I'LL PUT THEM ALL BACK.
- 哦，别担心，先生。螃蟹，
我会把它们全部放回去。

08:33.551 --> 08:36.551
- HURRY UP, SPONGEBOB.
I'M NO DOCTOR,
- 快点，海绵宝宝。
我不是医生，

08:36.655 --> 08:39.793
BUT I DON'T THINK SQUIRRELS
ARE SUPPOSED TO BE BLUE.
但我不认为是松鼠
应该是蓝色的。

08:39.896 --> 08:41.862
- OKAY, I'M READY.
- 好的，我准备好了。

08:41.965 --> 08:44.551
- JUST A LITTLE BIT FURTHER.
- 再远一点。

08:44.655 --> 08:45.620
OKAY, GOT IT.
好的，明白了。

08:45.724 --> 08:46.689
- HURRY UP, PATRICK.
- 快点，帕特里克。

08:46.793 --> 08:49.068
- [sucking]
- [吸吮]

08:53.000 --> 08:54.344
- MM-MM.
- MM-MM。
- MM-MM。
- MM-MM。
- MM-MM。
- MM-MM。
- MM-MM。
- MM-MM。

09:02.551 --> 09:04.862
- LOOKS LIKE HER COLOR'S
COMING BACK.
- 看起来像她的颜色
回来了。

09:04.965 --> 09:07.310
- THAT'S GOOD,
BUT IS IT GONNA BE GOOD ENOUGH?
- 很好，
但这就足够了吗？

09:07.413 --> 09:09.965
MR. KRABS, YOU MUST HAVE
SOME SPARE OXYGEN!
先生。螃蟹，你必须有
一些备用氧气！

09:10.068 --> 09:11.965
SQUIDWARD ALWAYS SAYS
YOU'RE FULL OF HOT AIR.
章鱼哥总是说
你充满了空谈。

09:12.068 --> 09:13.448
- I SAY WHAT?
- 我说什么？

09:13.551 --> 09:15.586
- SO YOU THINK I'M FULL
OF HOT AIR, DO YOU?
- 所以你认为我吃饱了
热空气，你呢？

09:15.689 --> 09:17.344
WELL, IN THIS CASE,
YOU'RE RIGHT.
那么，在这种情况下，
你是对的。

09:17.448 --> 09:22.551
THERE'S USUALLY AN AIR BUBBLE
OR TWO TRAPPED INSIDE MY SHELL.
通常有一个气泡
或者两个被困在我的壳里。

09:22.655 --> 09:27.482
GO AHEAD.
DON'T BE SHY.
前进。
不要害羞。

09:27.586 --> 09:29.931
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:30.034 --> 09:33.310
- DADDY, THERE'S A SUBMARINE
ON THE ROOF.
- 爸爸，有一艘潜艇
在屋顶上。

09:33.413 --> 09:35.689
OH.
YOU SEEM KIND OF BUSY.
哦。
你看起来有点忙。

09:35.793 --> 09:37.655
MAYBE I SHOULD COME BACK LATER.
也许我应该稍后再回来。

09:37.758 --> 09:39.310
- NO, PEARL, DON'T GO.
- 不，珀尔，别走。

09:39.413 --> 09:40.793
YOU'RE A MAMMAL, RIGHT?
你是哺乳动物，对吗？

09:40.896 --> 09:43.413
- YEAH, I-I GUESS SO.
- 是的，我-我想是的。

09:43.517 --> 09:45.172
- AND YOU BREATHE AIR, RIGHT?
- 你呼吸空气，对吧？

09:45.275 --> 09:47.793
- SURE. MY NOSE IS FULL OF IT.
- 当然。我的鼻子里全是它。

09:47.896 --> 09:49.275
- YOU'VE GOT TO HELP SANDY!
- 你必须帮助桑迪！

09:49.379 --> 09:51.137
SHE NEEDS TO SHARE YOUR AIR.
她需要分享你的空气。

09:51.241 --> 09:54.620
- I GUESS US MAMMALS HAVE
TO STICK TOGETHER.
- 我猜我们哺乳动物有
团结一致。

09:54.724 --> 09:59.655
- OKAY, HOLD STILL.
THIS MAY PINCH A LITTLE.
- 好吧，别动。
这可能会有点夹伤。

09:59.758 --> 10:01.344
OKAY, PEARL, LET 'ER RIP!
好吧，珍珠，让我们撕裂吧！

10:01.448 --> 10:04.793
- [inhaling deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

10:04.896 --> 10:05.931
- NOW JUST KEEP HER BREATHING,
PEARL.
- 现在只要保持她的呼吸，
珍珠。

10:06.034 --> 10:07.068
COME WITH ME, PATRICK.
跟我来，帕特里克。

10:07.172 --> 10:08.896
I HAVE AN IDEA THAT WILL FIX
EVERYTHING.
我有一个可以解决的想法
一切。

10:09.000 --> 10:12.172
I'M GONNA GO UP TO THE SURFACE
TO GET SOME AIR.
我要到地面
呼吸一些空气。

10:12.275 --> 10:15.034
WHEN I TUG ON THIS ROPE,
YOU PULL ME DOWN.
当我拉动这根绳子时
你把我拉下来。

10:15.137 --> 10:17.103
- BUT HOW YOU GONNA
GET UP THERE?
- 但你要怎么做
到那儿去吗？

10:17.206 --> 10:19.586
- I'LL USE THIS TANK OF OXYGEN
AS A MAKESHIFT ROCKET.
- 我会用这个氧气罐
作为临时火箭。

10:19.689 --> 10:21.758
- AN OXYGEN TANK?
- 氧气罐？

10:21.862 --> 10:24.034
GREAT IDEA, BUDDY!
好主意，伙计！

10:24.137 --> 10:25.034
- I KNOW.
- 我知道。

10:25.137 --> 10:28.172
WISH ME LUCK, OLD FRIEND.
祝我好运，老朋友。

10:28.275 --> 10:31.137
- SQUAREPANTS, I SALUTE YOU.
- 方裤们，我向你们致敬。

10:31.241 --> 10:34.137
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

10:34.241 --> 10:40.137
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

10:43.896 --> 10:47.793
- OKAY, SPONGEBOB, IT'S TIME TO
CATCH A BREATH...FOR SANDY!
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，是时候了
喘口气……为了桑迪！

10:47.896 --> 10:51.620
SO FRESH IT HURTS.
太新鲜了，太痛了。

10:56.241 --> 10:58.793
OKAY, PATRICK, PULL ME DOWN.
好吧，帕特里克，把我拉下来。

10:58.896 --> 11:00.827
- HEY! WHO DID THAT?
- 嘿！谁干的？

11:00.931 --> 11:05.379
HEY! A GHOST!
[screams]
嘿！幽灵！
[尖叫声]

11:05.482 --> 11:09.310
- YEAH, HERE WE GO.
- 是的，我们开始了。

11:09.413 --> 11:11.758
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

11:20.482 --> 11:22.931
- WELCOME BACK, SANDY.
- 欢迎回来，桑迪。

11:23.034 --> 11:24.379
- I'M ALIVE?
- 我还活着？

11:24.482 --> 11:26.724
AND THE TREE DOME'S
FULL OF AIR?
和树穹顶
充满空气？

11:26.827 --> 11:28.620
AND SORT OF DRY?
有点干？

11:28.724 --> 11:30.482
HOW'D YOU FELLAS PULL IT OFF?
你们是怎么做到的？

11:30.586 --> 11:35.103
- OH, YOU COULD SAY WE HAD A
LITTLE HELP FROM A BIG BUBBLE.
- 哦，你可以说我们有一个
大泡沫的帮助微乎其微。

11:35.206 --> 11:37.103
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:37.206 --> 11:38.310
- HMM.
- 唔。

11:38.413 --> 11:40.827
IN CASE YOU FORGOT,
IT WAS BUBBLES
如果你忘记了，
这是泡沫

11:40.931 --> 11:42.551
THAT GOT US INTO THIS MESS IN
THE FIRST PLACE.
这让我们陷入了困境
第一名。

11:42.655 --> 11:45.206
I DON'T WANT YOU BLOWING ANY
MORE BUBBLES AROUND MY HOUSE.
我不想让你吹任何东西
我的房子周围有更多气泡。

11:45.310 --> 11:49.689
both: UH-OH.
两人：呃-哦。

12:02.103 --> 12:04.034
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

12:04.137 --> 12:07.931
OH, BOY, I CAN'T WAIT TO SHOW
SANDY MY NEW KARATE MOVE.
哦，男孩，我迫不及待地想展示
桑迪，我的新空手道动作。

12:08.034 --> 12:10.620
[laughs]
[笑]

12:10.724 --> 12:12.551
OH, SANDY!
哦，桑迪！

12:12.655 --> 12:15.448
[gasps]
SANDY'S IN TROUBLE!
[喘气]
桑迪有麻烦了！

12:15.551 --> 12:20.103
DON'T WORRY, SANDY,
I'M COMING TO SAVE YOU.
别担心，桑迪，
我来救你了。

12:20.206 --> 12:23.551
- TRY AGAIN, SANDY.
YOUR KICK SHOULD FLY HIGHER.
- 再试一次，桑迪。
你的踢应该飞得更高。

12:23.655 --> 12:26.551
[rumbling]
- [yelling]
[隆隆声]
- [大喊]

12:26.655 --> 12:28.241
YAA!
是啊！

12:31.310 --> 12:34.275
- WHO IS THIS INTRUDER
THAT FAILS TO ATTACK ME?
- 这个入侵者是谁
那攻击不了我？

12:34.379 --> 12:35.344
- THAT'S MY FRIEND,
- 那是我的朋友，

12:35.448 --> 12:37.000
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
海绵宝宝。

12:37.103 --> 12:39.379
- WHOA. WHAT WAS THAT STENCH?
- 哇哦。那是什么恶臭？

12:39.482 --> 12:41.620
- THAT WAS WHAT WE
IN KARATE CALL
- 这就是我们的想法
在空手道通话中

12:41.724 --> 12:43.793
"THE SMELL OF DEATH."
“死亡的气味。”

12:43.896 --> 12:45.827
- YOU KNOW KARATE?
- 你知道空手道吗？

12:45.931 --> 12:47.689
- HE DOESN'T JUST KNOW KARATE,
- 他不仅仅懂得空手道，

12:47.793 --> 12:51.344
HE ISKARATE.
他是空手道。

12:51.448 --> 12:55.965
THIS HERE IS THE LEGENDARY
KARATE MASTER FUZZY ACORNS.
这就是传奇
空手道大师模糊橡子。

12:56.068 --> 12:58.551
FUZZY'S HERE TO TEST ME
FOR THE HIGHEST BELT IN KARATE.
模糊是来测试我的
空手道最高腰带。

12:58.655 --> 13:00.793
- BUT SANDY, YOU ALREADY HAVE
A BLACK BELT.
- 但是桑迪，你已经有了
黑带。

13:00.896 --> 13:03.344
- YES, BUT THERE'S ONE
EVEN HIGHER THAN THAT.
- 是的，但是有一个
甚至比那还要高。

13:03.448 --> 13:05.862
THE BLACKER BELT.
黑腰带。

13:05.965 --> 13:08.827
- GEE, WISH I HAD A KARATE BELT.
- 天啊，希望我有一条空手道腰带。

13:08.931 --> 13:12.344
- IF YOU WANT A BELT,
YOU MUST EARN IT.
- 如果你想要一条腰带，
你必须赢得它。

13:12.448 --> 13:14.034
- OKAY, HOW DO I DO THAT?
- 好吧，我该怎么做？

13:14.137 --> 13:15.551
- DO YOU GOT COTTON
IN YOUR EYES?
- 你有棉花吗
在你眼中？

13:15.655 --> 13:18.620
WHAT DO YOU THINK I'M HERE FOR?
- HUH?
你认为我来这里是为了什么？
- 嗯？

13:18.724 --> 13:19.758
- I AM THE MIGHTY OAK
- 我是强大的橡树

13:19.862 --> 13:22.448
AND YOU ARE BUT A SAPLING.
而你只是一棵树苗。

13:22.551 --> 13:24.448
- I'M SORRY, I-I'M CONFUSED.
- 对不起，我-我很困惑。

13:24.551 --> 13:28.068
- I'M HERE TO SEPARATE
THE WHEAT FROM THE CHAFF.
- 我是来分开的
谷壳中的小麦。

13:28.172 --> 13:29.172
NO?
- UH-UH.
不？
- 呃呃。

13:29.275 --> 13:31.241
- OH, THAT LAST ONE
USUALLY WORKS.
- 哦，最后一个
通常有效。

13:31.344 --> 13:33.827
- WHAT FUZZY'S TRYING TO SAY IS
THAT HE'S HERE TO JUDGE
- FUZZY 想说的是
他是来评判的

13:33.931 --> 13:36.586
WHETHER ANYONE'S WORTHY
OF GETTING A KARATE BELT OR NOT.
是否有人值得
是否获得空手道腰带。

13:36.689 --> 13:38.551
- BUT HOW CAN ANYONE
EVER TRULY KNOW
- 但谁能
曾经真正知道

13:38.655 --> 13:40.241
WHETHER HE OR SHE IS WORTHY?
他或她是否值得？

13:40.344 --> 13:41.241
- IT IS SIMPLE.
- 很简单。

13:41.344 --> 13:43.137
I CONDUCT A SERIES OF TESTS
我进行了一系列测试

13:43.241 --> 13:45.620
AND IF YOU PASS,
I WILL GIVE YOU A BELT
如果你通过了，
我会给你一条腰带

13:45.724 --> 13:47.724
THAT SHOWS YOU KNOW KARATE.
这表明您了解空手道。

13:50.551 --> 13:52.965
THE FIRST TEST IS SIMPLE.
第一个测试很简单。

13:53.068 --> 13:57.034
SPLIT A LOG WITH ONE HAND CHOP,
LIKE SO.
用一只手劈开原木，
像这样。

13:57.137 --> 14:02.551
YOUR TURN, KARATE MAN.
轮到你了，空手道人。

14:02.655 --> 14:06.896
- MM-HM, YEAH, OKAY.
- 嗯嗯，是的，好的。

14:07.000 --> 14:08.344
- PLEASE PROCEED.
- 请继续。

14:08.448 --> 14:14.241
- OKAY, PREPARE TO SEE
THE SPLIT OF YOUR LIFE!
- 好吧，准备看看
你生命的分裂！

14:14.344 --> 14:15.931
- MASTERY OF THIS TEST
- 掌握这个测试

14:16.034 --> 14:20.275
WILL SHOW ME YOU'RE READY FOR
THE NEXT LEVEL OF KARATE-DOM.
会让我知道你已经准备好
空手道的新境界。

14:20.379 --> 14:25.379
HIYA!
[shouting]
嗨！
[喊叫]

14:25.482 --> 14:28.689
ALL RIGHT. YOUR TURN.
好的。轮到你了。

14:28.793 --> 14:31.137
- AND TURN I WILL.
[laughs]
- 我会的。
[笑]

14:31.241 --> 14:33.413
- JUST DO THE THING
WITH THE THING PLEASE.
- 只管做事
请与那件事一起。

14:36.517 --> 14:39.379
[piano keys trilling]
[钢琴键颤音]

14:39.482 --> 14:44.275
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

14:44.379 --> 14:45.620
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

14:45.724 --> 14:48.551
[crash]
[碰撞]

14:48.655 --> 14:51.655
- WE SHALL SETTLE THIS
ON THE BATTLEFIELD TOMORROW.
- 我们会解决这个问题
明天的战场。

14:51.758 --> 14:54.068
YOU TWO WILL FIGHT EACH OTHER.
你们两个会互相争斗。

14:54.172 --> 14:56.931
IF I SEE YOU HAVE THE SKILL OF
REAL HAND-TO-HAND COMBAT,
如果我看到你有以下技能
真正的肉搏战，

14:57.034 --> 14:58.862
I WILL AWARD YOU
WITH KARATE BELTS.
我会奖励你
带空手道腰带。

14:58.965 --> 15:02.206
OTHERWISE YOU GET NOTHING.
否则你什么也得不到。

15:02.310 --> 15:03.827
- OH, WAIT, SENSEI, HOW--
- 哦，等等，老师，怎么样——

15:03.931 --> 15:06.896
- NO MORE TALK. ONLY DO.
- 别再说了。只做。

15:07.000 --> 15:09.482
- BETTER RUN ON HOME AND
PRACTICE, SPONGEBOB.
- 更好地在家和
练习吧，海绵宝宝。

15:09.586 --> 15:11.862
SEE YOU TOMORROW.
明天见。

15:11.965 --> 15:14.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

15:14.965 --> 15:18.586
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

15:18.689 --> 15:22.034
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

15:27.724 --> 15:31.965
HI-YOW!
嗨哟！

15:32.068 --> 15:36.965
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

15:37.068 --> 15:38.724
[yelling]
[大喊]

15:38.827 --> 15:41.758
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:45.241 --> 15:47.862
[triumphant yell]
[胜利的呐喊]

15:52.206 --> 15:53.103
[rooster crowing]
[公鸡打鸣]

15:53.206 --> 15:55.034
- THE MATCH!
- 比赛！

15:55.137 --> 15:57.862
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

16:01.413 --> 16:02.275
I CAN'T GET OUT OF HERE!
我无法离开这里！

16:02.379 --> 16:05.862
[meows]
[喵喵]

16:05.965 --> 16:08.344
THANKS, GARY.
谢谢，加里。

16:08.448 --> 16:09.896
[meows]
[喵喵]

16:10.000 --> 16:12.068
- WHERE IS THE SOFT ONE?
- 软的在哪里？

16:12.172 --> 16:13.551
THE MATCH STARTS IN...
比赛开始于...

16:13.655 --> 16:15.931
[muttering]
RIGHT NOW!
[嘀咕]
现在！

16:16.034 --> 16:18.241
- HERE. I'M RIGHT HERE.
- 这里。我就在这里。

16:18.344 --> 16:19.655
I HAVE READIED MYSELF
我已经准备好

16:19.758 --> 16:22.379
INTO A FULL STATE OF READINESS,
进入完全准备状态，

16:22.482 --> 16:23.827
AND I AM READY
我准备好了

16:23.931 --> 16:24.827
TO BE READY.
做好准备。

16:24.931 --> 16:26.068
I'M SO TIRED.
我太累了。

16:26.172 --> 16:29.655
I'M SO TIRED, SO...
SO VERY TIRED.
我好累，所以...
太累了。

16:29.758 --> 16:31.000
- YOU SURE YOU WANNA DO THIS,
BUDDY?
- 你确定你想这样做，
好友？

16:31.103 --> 16:32.517
- ENOUGH TALK!
- 够了！

16:32.620 --> 16:35.000
IF YOU WANT YOUR BELT, YOU'RE
GONNA HAVE TO TUSSLE IT OUT.
如果您想要腰带，那么您就是
必须要解决这个问题。

16:35.103 --> 16:37.413
SO LET THE MATCH BEGIN!
比赛开始吧！

16:37.517 --> 16:39.448
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

16:45.103 --> 16:47.482
- ALL RIGHT,
BRACE YOURSELF, SANDY,
- 好吧，
振作起来，桑迪，

16:47.586 --> 16:49.689
'CAUSE IT IS ABOUT TO GET
ROUGH AND TUMBLE.
因为它即将得到
崎岖不平。

16:49.793 --> 16:53.103
- OKAY, SPONGEBOB, YOU GOTTA
CATCH ME FIRST!
- 好吧，海绵宝宝，你必须这么做
先抓住我！

16:53.206 --> 16:56.482
- [whooping]
- [呼喊]

16:59.896 --> 17:01.965
- MOST IMPRESSIVE, SANDY,
- 最令人印象深刻的是，桑迪，

17:02.068 --> 17:04.655
BUT I AM HERE
TO EVALUATE SPONGEBOB.
但我在这里
评估海绵宝宝。

17:04.758 --> 17:08.206
LET'S SEE WHAT HE CAN DO
ON THE OFFENSIVE.
让我们看看他能做什么
进攻。

17:08.310 --> 17:13.103
- OW!
- 噢！

17:13.206 --> 17:18.068
OKAY, SANDY.
[karate yell]
好的，桑迪。
[空手道大喊]

17:18.172 --> 17:20.827
PREPARE FOR MY FINISHING MOVE.
为我的终结动作做好准备。

17:20.931 --> 17:23.379
I CALL IT "THE SLEEPER."
我称之为“睡眠者”。

17:23.482 --> 17:25.137
[snoring]
- HUH?
[打鼾]
- 嗯？

17:25.241 --> 17:26.896
- VERY GOOD, SANDY.
- 很好，桑迪。

17:27.000 --> 17:32.103
YOU PUT YOUR OPPONENT TO SLEEP
IN UNDER ONE MINUTE!
你让你的对手入睡
一分钟内！

17:32.206 --> 17:33.379
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

17:33.482 --> 17:35.931
- TOO BAD YOUR OPPONENT DIDN'T
PUT UP A FIGHT.
- 可惜你的对手没有
奋战吧。

17:36.034 --> 17:38.551
I WAS PREPARED TO GIVE YOU THE
LOWEST OF BELTS...
我准备给你
最低的腰带...

17:38.655 --> 17:39.793
THE CLEAR BELT!
透明腰带！

17:39.896 --> 17:41.344
[laughs]
[笑]

17:41.448 --> 17:45.034
BUT NOW I REALIZE YOU'RE UNFIT
TO WEAR A BELT OF ANY KIND.
但现在我意识到你不适合
佩戴任何类型的腰带。

17:45.137 --> 17:49.689
INCLUDING THE ONE THAT HOLDS UP
YOUR PANTS!
包括能支撑住的那一个
你的裤子！

17:49.793 --> 17:51.310
- DON'T BE DISAPPOINTED,
SPONGEBOB.
- 不要失望，
海绵宝宝。

17:51.413 --> 17:53.655
A BELT ISN'T THE MOST IMPORTANT
THING IN KARATE.
腰带并不是最重要的
空手道中的事情。

17:53.758 --> 17:54.896
- EASY FOR YOU TO SAY, SANDY.
- 桑迪，你说起来容易。

17:55.000 --> 17:57.344
YOUR PANTS AREN'T DOWN AROUND
YOUR ANKLES.
你的裤子没脱下来
你的脚踝。

17:57.448 --> 18:00.724
- AND I'M REVOKING
YOUR BLACK BELT!
- 我要撤销
你的黑带！

18:00.827 --> 18:02.310
- HEY, YOU CAN'T DO THAT!
- 嘿，你不能这样做！

18:02.413 --> 18:05.758
- OH, YES, I CAN.
FOR WASTING MY TIME
- 哦，是的，我可以。
浪费我的时间

18:05.862 --> 18:09.241
BRINGING ME
THIS SORRY EXCUSE FOR A STUDENT!
带我来
这是对学生的抱歉借口！

18:09.344 --> 18:12.172
STICK TO SOMETHING
YOU'RE GOOD AT, SON.
坚持某件事
你很擅长，儿子。

18:12.275 --> 18:14.586
- YES, SENSEI.
- 是的，老师。

18:18.689 --> 18:21.551
- THAT WAS PRETTY LOW-DOWN,
FUZZY,
- 那是相当低调的，
模糊，

18:21.655 --> 18:23.793
THE WAY YOU HUMILIATED
MY FRIEND.
你被羞辱的方式
我的朋友。

18:23.896 --> 18:26.172
- THE SPONGE ONE WILL NEVER
EARN HIS BELT.
- 海绵一号永远不会
赢得他的腰带。

18:26.275 --> 18:28.137
- I KNOW SPONGEBOB
WILL IMPRESS YOU
- 我认识海绵宝宝
会给您留下深刻印象

18:28.241 --> 18:29.758
IF YOU GIVE HIM
ONE MORE CHANCE.
如果你给他
再一次机会。

18:29.862 --> 18:31.793
- SILENCE!
NO MORE CHANCES.
- 安静！
没有更多的机会了。

18:31.896 --> 18:33.655
SENSEI NEVER GIVES
TWO CHANCES.
老师从不给予
两次机会。

18:33.758 --> 18:36.758
IF YOU REALLY WANT
TO IMPRESS ME,
如果你真的想要
为了给我留下深刻的印象，

18:36.862 --> 18:39.275
SHOW ME WHERE I CAN GET
A DECENT MEAL AROUND HERE.
显示我可以去哪里
这里有一顿不错的饭菜。

18:39.379 --> 18:41.206
LUNCHTIME APPROACHES.
午餐时间临近。

18:41.310 --> 18:42.482
- [gasps]
THAT'S IT!
- [喘气]
就是这样！

18:42.586 --> 18:44.448
I'LL TAKE HIM
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB,
我会带他
致脆皮蟹，

18:44.551 --> 18:46.931
AND THEN HE MIGHT JUST FIND
HIMSELF IMPRESSED
然后他可能会发现
自己印象深刻

18:47.034 --> 18:48.413
BY A CERTAIN SANDWICH-MAKER.
由某个三明治制造商制作。

18:48.517 --> 18:52.344
- WHO ARE YOU TALKING TO?
- 你在跟谁说话？

18:52.448 --> 18:54.034
- COME ON, SPONGEBOB.
- 来吧，海绵宝宝。

18:54.137 --> 18:56.206
WHAT'S WRONG WITH YOU?
GET GRILLING!
你这人怎么回事？
开始烧烤吧！

18:56.310 --> 18:57.965
- SQUIDWARD, I...
[sniffs]
- 章鱼哥，我……
[嗅嗅]

18:58.068 --> 18:59.827
I FAILED MY KARATE EXAM.
我空手道考试没通过。

18:59.931 --> 19:02.206
- WHICH IS EXACTLY WHY
I KEEP TELLING YOU
- 这就是为什么
我一直告诉你

19:02.310 --> 19:03.620
NEVER TRY ANYTHING NEW.
永远不要尝试任何新事物。

19:03.724 --> 19:05.068
EVER.
曾经。

19:05.172 --> 19:07.758
STICK TO WHAT YOU'RE GOOD AT!
AND STICK TO IT SOON.
坚持你擅长的事情！
并尽快坚持下去。

19:07.862 --> 19:10.586
- STICK TO WHAT I'M GOOD AT.
- 坚持我擅长的事情。

19:10.689 --> 19:13.896
HEY, SQUIDWARD'S RIGHT.
嘿，章鱼哥是对的。

19:17.965 --> 19:20.793
- ARE YOU SURE YOU DON'T NEED
AN AIR HELMET?
- 你确定你不需要吗
空气头盔？

19:20.896 --> 19:22.310
- HEH. THIS WON'T TAKE LONG.
- 呵呵。这不会花很长时间。

19:22.413 --> 19:26.413
FUZZY HAS TRAINED HIMSELF
TO GO HOURS WITHOUT AIR.
模糊已经自我训练
在没有空气的情况下工作几个小时。

19:29.275 --> 19:31.206
- HOW 'BOUT THEM MOVES?
- 他们移动得怎么样？

19:31.310 --> 19:34.034
- PRETTY OKAY...FOR A FRY COOK.
- 相当不错...对于炒菜厨师来说。

19:34.137 --> 19:36.586
- SPONGEBOB,
20 MORE ORDERS HERE.
- 海绵宝宝，
这里还有 20 个订单。

19:36.689 --> 19:39.793
- 20!
GOT IT, SQUIDWARD.
- 20！
明白了，章鱼哥。

19:39.896 --> 19:42.862
[cheering]
[欢呼]

19:42.965 --> 19:45.310
- WELL, THAT SURE TOOK SOME
AGILITY.
- 嗯，这确实需要一些时间
敏捷性。

19:45.413 --> 19:47.310
- SIMPLE PARLOR TRICKS.
- 简单的客厅技巧。

19:53.068 --> 19:58.551
YUCK, A KUNG-FU CHARLATAN.
恶心，一个功夫江湖骗子。

19:58.655 --> 20:00.413
- NOW YOU'RE CONVINCED.
- 现在你确信了。

20:00.517 --> 20:02.517
- I'VE SEEN BETTER.
- 我见过更好的。

20:02.620 --> 20:06.103
- HEY, SPONGEBOB, I'D LIKE MY
PATTY IN TWELFTHS PLEASE.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝，我想要我的
请给帕蒂十二分之一。

20:06.206 --> 20:11.275
- TWELFTHS. OKAY.
- 十二分之一。好的。

20:11.379 --> 20:12.482
THERE YOU GO, SANDY.
好了，桑迪。

20:12.586 --> 20:13.965
- HUH?
- 嗯？

20:14.068 --> 20:17.137
MAYHAPS SQUISHY-BOY IS MORE
SKILLED THAN I FIRST THOUGHT.
也许 SQUISHY-BOY 更重要
比我最初想象的熟练。

20:17.241 --> 20:20.241
- TOLD YA.
- NOT SO FAST, SQUIRREL CHEEKS.
- 告诉你了。
- 别那么快，松鼠脸颊。

20:20.344 --> 20:24.655
THE ONLY WAY TO TRULY KNOW
IS TO TEST HIM MYSELF.
真正了解的唯一方法
就是要亲自考验他。

20:30.413 --> 20:32.586
[yelling]
[大喊]

20:32.689 --> 20:34.482
- HEY, WAITER,
AN EMPTY PLATE?
- 嘿，服务员，
空盘子？

20:34.586 --> 20:36.586
- [shouting]
- [喊叫]

20:36.689 --> 20:41.413
- OH, I FORGOT THE FRIES!
- 哦，我忘了炸薯条！

20:41.517 --> 20:44.275
- NOW I SEE YOU ARE
A SKILLED OPPONENT
- 现在我看到你了
技术精湛的对手

20:44.379 --> 20:48.241
WITH THE COLD-BLOODED HEART
OF A WARRIOR!
带着冷血的心
战士的！

20:48.344 --> 20:50.862
- YOU LITTLE KRABBY PATTIES
ARE SO CUTE!
- 你们这些小蟹肉饼
太可爱了！

20:50.965 --> 20:54.758
HMM, SOMETHING'S
NOT RIGHT HERE.
嗯，有东西
不在这里。

20:54.862 --> 20:58.931
IT'S THE ONIONS.
THEY'VE GONE BAD.
这是洋葱。
他们变坏了。

20:59.034 --> 21:01.655
- HE'S ON THE OFFENSIVE.
- 他正在进攻。

21:01.758 --> 21:04.551
TIME FOR YOU TO END THIS.
是时候让你结束这一切了。

21:10.241 --> 21:14.931
- THAT'S SHOWING HIM,
SPONGEBOB.
- 这表明他，
海绵宝宝。

21:15.034 --> 21:16.724
YOU GONNA GIVE HIM A BELT,
FUZZY?
你要给他一条腰带，
模糊？

21:16.827 --> 21:18.586
OR HAVE YOU NOT
HAD ENOUGH YET?
或者你没有
还够了吗？

21:18.689 --> 21:20.448
- YOU BROUGHT ME
TO THE DANCE,
- 你带来了我
舞蹈，

21:20.551 --> 21:23.310
BUT THE UNIVERSE
IS CUTTING IN.
但宇宙
正在切入。

21:23.413 --> 21:25.862
- HUH?
- OKAY, LOOKING GOOD.
- 嗯？
- 好吧，看起来不错。

21:25.965 --> 21:27.862
- SPONGE-MAN!
- 海绵侠！

21:27.965 --> 21:30.000
SMELL THE VIBRATIONS!
闻一下振动的味道！

21:30.103 --> 21:34.379
- MAKE THE FRIES!
I ALMOST FORGOT.
- 做薯条！
我差点忘了。

21:34.482 --> 21:35.482
- MORE PATTIES.
- 更多肉饼。

21:35.586 --> 21:37.965
- GRILLING THEM NOW.
- 现在就烤。

21:38.068 --> 21:40.620
YOUR FRIES, SIR.
您的薯条，先生。

21:40.724 --> 21:43.724
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

21:43.827 --> 21:45.482
- AND YOUR FRIES, SIR.
-还有你的薯条，先生。

21:45.586 --> 21:48.965
KETCHUP? OOPS.
番茄酱？哎呀。

21:49.068 --> 21:52.310
GOT IT.
OH, FUZZY!
知道了。
哦，模糊！

21:52.413 --> 21:53.689
- OH, NO!
- 哦，不！

21:53.793 --> 21:55.517
- SENSEI FUZZY, ARE YOU OKAY?
- 模糊老师，你还好吗？

21:55.620 --> 21:58.448
- I WAS WRONG ABOUT YOU,
SPONGEBOB.
- 我对你的看法是错误的
海绵宝宝。

21:58.551 --> 21:59.827
YOU HAVE BESTED FUZZY
你已经战胜了模糊

21:59.931 --> 22:02.413
WITH YOUR KARATE GREATNESS.
发挥您的空手道天赋。

22:02.517 --> 22:04.103
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

22:04.206 --> 22:08.379
YOU ARE NOW A KARATE MASTER.
HERE.
您现在是空手道大师了。
这里。

22:08.482 --> 22:11.137
- FOR ME?
THANKS, SENSEI FUZZY!
- 为我？
谢谢模糊老师！

22:11.241 --> 22:13.482
FUZZY, YOU LOOK TERRIBLE!
模糊，你看起来很糟糕！

22:13.586 --> 22:15.586
- [mumbling incoherently]
- [语无伦次地咕哝]

22:15.689 --> 22:17.517
- SANDY, WHAT'S WRONG
WITH FUZZY?
- 桑迪，怎么了
模糊？

22:17.620 --> 22:18.827
- I KNOW WHAT HE NEEDS.
- 我知道他需要什么。

22:18.931 --> 22:20.103
HE JUST NEEDS THIS.
他只需要这个。

22:20.206 --> 22:21.551
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

22:21.655 --> 22:23.931
NO MORE TALK!
别再说了！

22:24.034 --> 22:25.517
ONLY DO!
只做！

22:25.620 --> 22:29.275
SANDY, MY DEAR, FOR HOLDING
YOUR OWN AGAINST THE SPONGE,
桑迪，亲爱的，坚持下去
你自己的海绵，

22:29.379 --> 22:32.689
YOU HAVE TRULY PROVEN YOURSELF
WORTHY OF...
你已经真正证明了自己
值得...

22:32.793 --> 22:36.413
THE BLACKER BELT!
黑腰带！

22:38.896 --> 22:42.379
both: THANKS, FUZZY!
两人：谢谢，模糊！

22:42.482 --> 22:47.517
- WHY MUST THE UNIVERSE
CONFOUND ME SO?
- 为什么宇宙必须
让我这么困惑吗？

22:47.620 --> 22:50.793
[laughter]
[笑声]

[笑声]